==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Doge Darks and Doges can be a source of money if you can manage them. You can use a similar strategy to that of [[Fluffy Dark Weapon]] and remember to bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats to deal with Shy Boy. If you have [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], then use them as your main source of DPS against the Shy Boy.

[[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] can easily [[Weaken|weaken]] Shy Boy continuously, essentially cutting his damage in half. This will allow you to stack ranged attackers or more anti-floating crowd-controllers like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]]. [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] can make this stage extremely easy with his 100% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]].


